{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9293","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9293/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9293/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9293/events","html_url":"https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9293","id":987423761,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU5ODc0MjM3NjE=","number":9293,"title":"Public IPs of Azure virtual machines in scale sets are not exposed by the `__meta_azure_machine_public_ip` label in `azure_sd_config`","user":{"login":"lisushka","id":28942094,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4OTQyMDk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28942094?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka","html_url":"https://github.com/lisushka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lisushka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":216836002,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTY4MzYwMDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"006b75","default":true,"description":null},{"id":365563588,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNjU1NjM1ODg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"ff0000","default":false,"description":null},{"id":365567641,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNjU1Njc2NDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/labels/component/service%20discovery","name":"component/service discovery","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":null},{"id":647013637,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDcwMTM2Mzc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/labels/priority/P3","name":"priority/P3","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2021-09-03T05:53:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-12T23:20:52Z","closed_at":"2024-07-16T11:07:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**What did you do?**\r\n\r\nWe have Azure virtual machines that are part of a virtual machine scale set.  We attempted to scrape metrics from them using the following `azure_sd_configs` block:\r\n```\r\nazure_sd_configs:\r\n  - environment: AzurePublicCloud\r\n    port: 9182\r\n    subscription_id: ***\r\n    tenant_id: ***\r\n    client_id: ***\r\n    client_secret: ***\r\n    refresh_interval: 5m\r\n    authentication_method: OAuth\r\n  relabel_configs:\r\n  - source_labels: [__meta_azure_machine_tag_prometheus]\r\n    separator: ;\r\n    regex: true.*\r\n    replacement: $1\r\n    action: keep\r\n  - source_labels: [__meta_azure_machine_tag_node_exporter]\r\n    separator: ;\r\n    regex: true.*\r\n    replacement: $1\r\n    action: keep\r\n  - source_labels: [__meta_azure_machine_name]\r\n    separator: ;\r\n    regex: (.*)\r\n    target_label: instance\r\n    replacement: $1\r\n    action: replace\r\n```\r\n\r\n**What did you expect to see?**\r\n\r\nWe expected that the public IP addresses of the virtual machines would be visible in Prometheus under the `__meta_azure_machine_public_ip` label.\r\n\r\n**What did you see instead? Under which circumstances?**\r\n\r\nThe private IP addresses of the virtual machines are visible under the `__meta_azure_machine_private_ip` tag, but the public IP addresses are not visible:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1003\" alt=\"Screenshot of Azure console showing partially consored virtual machine public and private IP addresses\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/28942094/131953807-4578adfe-9fe2-4b95-bcde-21adf8a5d9a7.png\">\r\n<img width=\"625\" alt=\"Screenshot of Prometheus labels for the same image, showing the private IP address label but not the public IP address label\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/28942094/131953812-a56f5665-1c5b-4be4-a0b4-21e95e08f67b.png\">\r\n\r\n* Prometheus version:\r\n\r\n\tWe have tested with both `prometheus:v2.29.2` and `prometheus:v2.20.1`.\r\n\r\n* Prometheus configuration file:\r\n```\r\nazure_sd_configs:\r\n  - environment: AzurePublicCloud\r\n    port: 9182\r\n    subscription_id: ***\r\n    tenant_id: ***\r\n    client_id: ***\r\n    client_secret: ***\r\n    refresh_interval: 5m\r\n    authentication_method: OAuth\r\n  relabel_configs:\r\n  - source_labels: [__meta_azure_machine_tag_prometheus]\r\n    separator: ;\r\n    regex: true.*\r\n    replacement: $1\r\n    action: keep\r\n  - source_labels: [__meta_azure_machine_tag_node_exporter]\r\n    separator: ;\r\n    regex: true.*\r\n    replacement: $1\r\n    action: keep\r\n  - source_labels: [__meta_azure_machine_name]\r\n    separator: ;\r\n    regex: (.*)\r\n    target_label: instance\r\n    replacement: $1\r\n    action: replace\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"bboreham","id":8125524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMjU1MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8125524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham","html_url":"https://github.com/bboreham","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bboreham/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9293/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9293/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}